  abilityName: Tide Break Counter
  description: '- Effect: Nikita braces herself against an incoming attack. If the
    counter succeeds, she reduces the damage received and retaliates against the
    attacker.

    - Explanation: Nikita uses her athletic reflexes to turn an opponent''s
    aggression against them. This gives her a defensive option without making her
    a dedicated tank.'
